            <div xml:id="d223">

                <pb facs="0220" n="208" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg208"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.00/1959: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-08T20:00:00+03:25">December 8, 1942—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 9—9:16 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>425. My 424. Crowd is now out of hand and rioting has developed on widespread and
                    severe scale. Shopping area is being looted by uncontrolled mobs. Police and
                    army are coming belatedly into action. Damage is heavy and there have been
                    casualties.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
